        <dc:description>&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kimball Kinnison leaves the Academy with the Lens on his wrist and orders to break the pirates of Boskone. Third of the Lensman books by internal chronology, and the first of them to be written; serialised in &lt;em&gt;Astounding Stories&lt;/em&gt; from September 1937 to February 1938.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</dc:description>
